  • UNAOS_WITNESS: kernel8 carries the M6b..U7 fixture battery (CAPSTONE + PASS lines)
  • UNAOS_TESTS_AT_BOOT: kernel8 runs the desktop fixture registry at boot (R77 M3)
  • UNAOS_CENSUS: kernel8 boots with every periodic census sampler on (R80)
  • UNAOS_USBNET: kernel8 carries the USB Ethernet link (CDC-ECM + AX88179 front-ends)
  • UNAOS_SMP7: per-core secondary bring-up evidence + the [smp7] online/missed verdict
  • UNAOS_V3D: V3D GPU foundation bring-up (probe/MMU/clear; attended-metal for positive verify)
  • UNAOS_VUGPAR: band-parallel flush across free secondary cores (bands=N in [vugfps]; serial fallback)
  • UNAOS_WEDGE2: <F1>..<F9> raw-UART breadcrumbs on the TAB->focus-raise chain (tokens may interleave with other serial lines — by design)
  • UNAOS_PIUSB: BCM2711 PCIe RC + VL805 xHCI attach (attended-metal for positive verify)
  • UNAOS_GENET: BCM2711 GENET v5 GbE + smoltcp bind (M1 probe classifies QEMU modelling; attended-metal for link/DHCP)
  • UNAOS_NETTEST: QEMU TCP/HTTP/mDNS loopback gate (NET-GATE witness; hardware-free)
  • UNAOS_PIRAST: software-rasterizer spinning cube on the BCM2711 panel (first 3D pixels on the Pi; 90 paced frames, then the shell repaints)
  • UNAOS_PIDESK: desktop furniture on the BCM2711 panel (dock window-switcher strip + SHARD menu; menu bar default OFF), clicks routed through the Pi mouse
  • UNAOS_QUARRY: the file manager on the BCM2711 panel (volume tree + detailed list + scrolling; arrows/Enter/Backspace/Esc, click, and the dock's pinned tile)
  • UNAOS_LOGIN: human users — /USERS.DAT record store, login/logout session principal (user:<name>), /home/<user> at first login
  • UNAOS_LUMEN: LUMENBIN — the lumen dock pin in the default set (the Pi image stages LUMEN.ELF since ARMAPPS SR100; tests lumen is x86) + HOLOCRONARM: APPS/HOLOCRON.ELF and the RINGLOGIN door
  • UNAOS_SELFDIAG: SELFDIAG — the boot log on disk + tests selfdiag + SYS_PATH_READ/WRITE (HOLOCRONARM: Holocron's store; DIAG.ELF is x86's)
  • UNAOS_HOLOCRON: the Holocron record store on the writable FAT volume (fs/holocron.rs; the framing fixture)
  • UNAOS_MIDDEN: MIDDENTWIN — tests midden (APPS/MIDDEN.ELF spawned, help + ls typed, its exit read back)
  • UNAOS_UNA: UNAMETAL — tests una (APPS/UNA.ELF spawned, Ctrl+3 + help typed, Ctrl+Q, its exit read back)
  • UNAOS_SONDE: REALSENSE — tests sonde (the D435i census; SKIP(no-device) without the camera); implies uvc
  • UNAOS_AETHER: AETHERMETAL — tests aether (APPS/AETHER.ELF spawned, its page report read); implies selfdiag
  • UNAOS_UVC: the USB Video Class driver (descriptor census, probe/commit, frames)
